Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:09.61,Ep_Title,Screentext,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(523,1)\q2\fs22\pos(610,308)\fscx99}Episode 15: Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event - Group Battle 1 -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:09.61,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}We're starting in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:16.91,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let's hear a few words of well-appreciated \Nencouragement from Iori Utahime-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:17.74,Main,Utahime,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:20.62,Main,Utahime,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:25.46,Italics,Utahime,0000,0000,0000,,Um, some degree of injury will be unavoidable,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.13,Italics,Utahime,0000,0000,0000,,but, um... now and then, help \Neach other out... or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.63,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:35.63,Italics,Utahime,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Gojou, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:39.30,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let the sister school exchange event...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:42.60,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.56,Italics,Utahime,0000,0000,0000,,Respect your seniors!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:46.23,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Ichiro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:47.90,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.31,0:00:49.98,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Toudou?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.94,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,What makes you think I would know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:54.53,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Can't we all get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:06.50,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Where do you think \Nthe cursed spirit boss is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.59,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It was probably unleashed \Nhalfway between both schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.96,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,but it's not just going to sit still.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:13.88,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,At the time we agreed upon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:17.59,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,we'll split up into the Megumi squad \Nand the Panda squad for scouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:19.97,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be counting on you after that, Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:20.80,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:28.90,Main,CursedSpirit15A,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:31.52,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,That's small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.70,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:48.12,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Great! You're all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.71,0:01:51.38,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Come at me all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:57.26,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Scatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:02.60,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Toudou was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:05.89,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,We were right to swap Yuuji into that role.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:12.52,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I already knew it, but he's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:13.40,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.15,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,So just ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:16.40,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:50.83,Show_Title,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1398,1)\c&H0F0D09&\3c&HB7BD80&\t(1236,1817,1 \3c&H85A2A4&)\t(1819,2945,1 \3c&H95DED9&)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:04:04.05,sign_26840_306_One_Month_Later,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1026,1)\an2\pos(320,305)\shad1.5\fscx90}Before the Exchange Event Started
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:04.05,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Toudou will absolutely be \Nout to crush us straight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:08.31,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Mai might follow behind him \Nto come after me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:11.23,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Toudou's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:16.15,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,The worst possible outcome would be \Nthat we all face him and get wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:21.57,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,So our plan was to leave just one person,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:24.53,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,either Panda or Megumi,\Nbehind to occupy him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:28.45,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori, we'll leave that role to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:33.29,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,We'd rather not lose anyone \Nwho can scout out our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.54,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:38.38,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Just hold out as long as \Npossible and buy us time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:40.42,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But you can be daring against him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:43.30,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,To be blunt, we weren't counting \Non your abilities anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.47,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,so it won't affect us too\Nmuch if you have to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.72,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.18,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.60,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted to face Toudou, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:54.39,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm good either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:55.98,Flashback,Pandra,0000,0000,0000,,You're super dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:00.44,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,But Senpai, if I'm gonna do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:04.49,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,then I'm gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.20,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Nice speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:12.08,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.16,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I landed a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.17,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll return the favor, first-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.96,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Guard like your life depends on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:28.76,Main,Cursedspirit15A,0000,0000,0000,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:43.57,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,My arm's... still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:46.74,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it got blown off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:48.82,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,If that cursed spirit \Nhadn't gotten in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:50.49,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,that would have been real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.61,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.91,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Now, which should I pursue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.67,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:53.89,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You think you can just pound \Naway at my head like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.72,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What if you made me even \Ndumber than I already am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.52,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:04.44,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Takada-chan said, "Men are perfect \Nwhen they're a little dumb."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:06.15,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:08.40,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not interested in any idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:11.16,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Then how did you know she's an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.07,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You know who she is, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:16.20,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name, first-year?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.70,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:20.29,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Itadori Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.71,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I have one question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.71,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of woman is your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:28.46,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:31.38,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What's my type?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:33.39,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you asking me that right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:37.22,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about that. \NI'm just appraising you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:43.73,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really get it, but if I had to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:51.82,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,A tall woman with a big ass, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:54.07,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Like Jennifer Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:12.17,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,The new series is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:12.90,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.61,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to confess to Takada-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.90,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:35.99,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna have to comfort you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:37.49,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,That's such a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:40.04,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you assuming she'll reject me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:46.04,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I could ask you why you \Nthink she'll say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:50.09,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Anne Sullivan once said to Helen Keller,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:54.26,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,"What fool thinks of defeat \Nbefore even trying?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:56.05,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Inoki was the one who said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:08:59.30,Flashback,Takada-chan,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:01.56,Flashback,Takada-chan,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already in love with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:22.08,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Any chance that someone is me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.50,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,No way, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.04,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.96,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll treat you to some ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:53.23,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You never lost to anyone \Nin your hometown, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:59.87,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like we're best friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:01.91,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,When you just learned my name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:05.75,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, continue straight that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.33,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Toudou-kun's there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.96,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:11.29,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,He's the one who told us to do as we pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:22.01,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,New Shadow Style, Simple Domain:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:25.56,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Quick Draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:32.77,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,What reflexes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:36.57,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I know I hesitated, but still, \Nmy counter didn't even scratch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:43.87,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surrounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:45.34,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:49.37,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Are these guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:54.84,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:01.39,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:05.26,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori and I switched places?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:07.93,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:13.52,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I'd kill you if \Nyou interfered, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:15.57,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:18.53,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,You said you'd kill us if \Nwe ordered you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.57,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Was that Itadori's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:23.28,Italics,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,No, it was Toudou's technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:26.33,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Same thing. Piss off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.17,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like he's retreating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:36.59,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.08,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.59,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.59,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,That depends on Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:45.47,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't order me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:47.26,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What's with these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:49.98,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,trying to kill me and then \Narguing with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:57.11,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,After all, I'm not an inconsiderate man \Nwho'd hold back against his best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:08.08,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,This is why I said to leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.29,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,We're off to a rocky start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:15.21,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,We can't start hunting down cursed spirits \Nwithout me scouting from the air, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:19.76,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,They're all such a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:21.72,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:23.13,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,You're as cute as ever today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:24.43,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:27.26,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:32.56,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Mai, Mechamaru, cover Nishimiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.39,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:36.28,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we {\i1}are{\i0} in trouble without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:50.95,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Kamo-san, are you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:53.58,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,planning to kill Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:02.97,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:07.97,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:12.62,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:13.60,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.39,0:13:16.90,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,All the Kyoto students are moving together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.11,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Toward the area we left Yuuji in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.69,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I think that puts everyone from Kyoto there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:26.32,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You mean that's where the target is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:29.91,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,No, unless the second-grade \Nis especially cunning,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.45,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,my Demon Dog would have noticed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:37.00,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They're trying to kill Itadori, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.57,0:13:39.88,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?! I don't see why!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.21,0:13:45.59,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:47.38,Flashback,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Kelp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:51.39,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't sense that much hostility from them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:54.81,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,but that was prior to Yuuji's surprise survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:14:01.42,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It's entirely possible that\NPrincipal Gakuganji would order that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:07.40,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Are the Kyoto students a bunch of cowards \Nwho'd kill a person on someone else's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:09.78,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,They don't see him the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:13.41,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You two have spent day after day with Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:17.21,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,We only recently learned that\Nhe's a good person ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:20.04,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,He's a naturally happy sort you \Ndon't often see among sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.42,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:24.92,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,To those who don't know \Nanything about Yuuji,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:29.43,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,the vessel of Sukuna \Nis just an object of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:33.43,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It wouldn't feel any different \Nfrom exorcising a curse to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:39.44,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Even normal jujutsu sorcerers \Ncan easily blur that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:44.69,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,We're turning back, Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:46.78,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.86,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,What are you apologizing for, dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:53.70,Flashback,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point in winning or losing \Nthe exchange event if your friend dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:59.62,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Nobara and I will go back \Nto confirm that Yuuji's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:01.83,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,He's not answering his phone, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:05.34,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Toge, you keep hunting down \Nthe cursed spirit, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:07.17,Flashback,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Bonito flakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.97,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I know you're worried about Yuuji, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:13.10,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But if my prediction is correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.60,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,the Kyoto students are trying
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:19.48,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,to use the chaos of the group\Nbattle to assassinate Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:23.13,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Once the group battle's over, \Nthere won't be any assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:24.32,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.48,Flashback,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:27.57,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried about Maki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.32,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,We won't let them kill Yuuji,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.11,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,and we'll win this group battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:32.91,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:40.12,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Answer on the first ring, Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:45.84,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Also, why didn't they provide us with \Nwireless radios or Bluetooth earbuds?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:48.13,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:51.01,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,They're distracting, and they startle \Nyou when you get a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:53.47,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You can take them off during combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:00.14,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.52,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,So that's Fushiguro-kun's Nue, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:06.90,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Electrified wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:09.57,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like they'll affect \Nmy movement for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:17.08,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Nishimiya-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:20.58,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Come and play!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:22.46,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,So crass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:23.83,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Not cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:28.30,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Kamo-san, are you guys \Nplanning to kill Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:32.30,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,And if I said we were?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:34.28,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You failed, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:37.81,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori wouldn't go down in such a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:43.73,Main,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,We have no reason to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.90,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:48.52,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The higher-ups and the three \Nmajor clans have plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.52,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What splendid toughness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:25.56,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,He's actively using the landscape \Nto his advantage, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:28.11,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:33.65,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,He's also quick to set up his next move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:43.67,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,And to top it off...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.05,0:17:48.13,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,He has such tremendous power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:51.59,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,His raw strength is greater than mine,\Ndespite his small body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:54.63,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Which is why his blows are effective \Nwith so little cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:59.64,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,And that makes it hard to read his movements \Nfrom the flow of cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:03.22,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,But the way this cursed \Nenergy hits after a time lag...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:06.06,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,That's just... That's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:10.86,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,...wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:14.07,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,3000)}...wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:15.65,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,3000)\alpha&H33&}...wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:17.32,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,3000)\alpha&H66&}...wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.99,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,3000)\alpha&H99&}...wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:20.70,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,3000)\alpha&HBB&}...wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.16,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Was that Toudou?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:27.16,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:32.34,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I think I understand why you \Nfailed to finish off Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:36.72,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,So why did you distance \Nyourself from Noritoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:39.76,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you keeping your technique \Na secret from your allies, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.39,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry about Itadori-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:51.27,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I know this is an excuse, \Nbut I'm not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:56.40,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Still, that doesn't mean I plan to hand \Nover victory in this exchange event.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:19:01.78,sign_30014_259_Recommendation,Screentext,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2}Recommendation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:19:01.78,sign_30014_259_Recommendation,Screentext,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2\pos(496,140)}Recommendation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:19:01.78,sign_30014_259_Recommendation,Screentext,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2\pos(144,206)}Recommendation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:19:01.78,sign_30014_259_Recommendation,Screentext,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2\pos(496,206)}Recommendation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:19:01.78,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,You know that sorcerers advance in rank \Nthrough a recommendation system, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:07.12,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,The exchange event is often discussed among \Nsorcerers without connections up the chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:09.92,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Students who perform well here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:13.79,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,are granted many chances to \Nadvance while they're studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:19.05,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coincidentally, the person in charge \Nof a student can't recommend them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:24.30,sign_30014_259_Recommendation,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs16\blur2\pos(220,170)}Recommendation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:24.30,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,For example, Gojou-san couldn't \Nrecommend Itadori-kun to be a first-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:29.31,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I want to become independent as\Nquickly as possible so I can earn money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:34.77,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:39.19,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.82,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,And I have two little brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.70,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:44.91,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you getting along well enough with Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.54,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you too nice a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.29,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.67,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I won't hold back, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:55.46,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Not a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:58.17,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I said all that for, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:02.01,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,My friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:04.51,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,That cursed energy you \Nblast with a time lag...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:06.89,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,That's a bad habit of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.89,0:20:08.68,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You mean Divergent Fist?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:11.85,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What's he on about all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:17.44,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,So long as you're satisfied with that, \Nyou'll never beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.90,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,If you're satisfied with \Nstaying on that level,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:24.07,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,you and I won't stay best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.33,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:29.45,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. I don't care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:31.79,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay with staying weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:37.50,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:40.88,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:44.55,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,My best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:17.48,sign_32727_342_Juju_Stroll,Girls&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Juju Stroll
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.48,0:22:21.73,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H476C72&\3c&HFFFFFF&\b1\shad0\b1\pos(320,221.333)}Q: What kind of person is your type?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.44,0:22:25.99,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Someone who's stronger \Nthan me, at the very least.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.40,0:22:30.24,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What makes you think I'll answer?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.69,0:22:33.75,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I totally can't stand a UBSSD.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.89,0:22:34.90,sign_36634_300_Useless,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\xshad-2\yshad0\pos(620,50)}Useless
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.26,0:22:34.90,sign_36634_300_Useless,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\xshad-2\yshad0\pos(620,100)}Broke
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.64,0:22:34.90,sign_36634_300_Useless,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\xshad-2\yshad0\pos(620,150)}Smelly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.02,0:22:34.90,sign_36634_300_Useless,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\xshad-2\yshad0\pos(620,200)}Stingy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.39,0:22:34.90,sign_36634_300_Useless,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\xshad-2\yshad0\pos(620,250)}Dead
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.24,0:22:37.78,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know who Sebastian Stan is?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.29,0:22:41.17,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,He has a great body.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.53,0:22:47.57,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you know, I like \Nhot guys, like most girls,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.57,0:22:50.84,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,but I want someone fun to be around, too,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.84,0:22:57.56,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,and it's important whether or not he can \Nmake you feel like he's the only one for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.05,0:23:02.72,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, gosh, how embarrassing!
